{"words": [{"text": "لَقَدْ", "translation": "Certainly"}, {"text": "مَنَّ", "translation": "bestowed a Favor"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "upon"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translation": "the believers"}, {"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "as"}, {"text": "بَعَثَ", "translation": "He raised"}, {"text": "فِيهِمْ", "translation": "among them"}, {"text": "رَسُولًۭا", "translation": "a Messenger"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "أَنفُسِهِمْ", "translation": "themselves"}, {"text": "يَتْلُوا۟", "translation": "reciting"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ", "translation": "His Verses"}, {"text": "وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ", "translation": "and purifying them"}, {"text": "وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ", "translation": "and teaching them"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ", "translation": "and the wisdom"}, {"text": "وَإِن", "translation": "although"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "they were"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "قَبْلُ", "translation": "before (that)"}, {"text": "لَفِى", "translation": "certainly in"}, {"text": "ضَلَـٰلٍۢ", "translation": "(the) error"}, {"text": "مُّبِينٍ", "translation": "clear"}], "sahih": "Certainly did Allāh confer [great] favor upon the believers when He sent among them a Messenger from themselves, reciting to them His verses and purifying them and teaching them the Book [i.e., the Qur’ān] and wisdom,1 although they had been before in manifest error."}